Removed material
----------------
sim/riscv_asm.sv, a disassembly helper derived from
github.com/jeras/riscv_asm.sv, was used by the testbench monitor in
versions up to v0.1.0-baseline. Its upstream license could not be
confirmed (the upstream repository is no longer publicly available), so
it was removed and replaced by sim/rv32i_disasm.sv, written for this
project from the RISC-V ISA specification and licensed under Apache-2.0.
